2. 保留全部版权声明、作者署名、版本标识与本协议全文；
   all copyright notices, attribution, version identifiers and this Agreement are retained in full;
3. 不收取任何费用，不与商业产品捆绑，不以本软件招揽付费服务；
   no fee is charged, no bundling with commercial products, and no paid services are solicited by means of the Software;
4. 明确注明软件来源与原作者的 GitHub 仓库地址。
   the origin of the Software and the Author's GitHub repository are clearly stated.

