2. 修改本软件或制作衍生作品，包括但不限于改名、换皮、增删功能、替换界面；
   modify the Software or create derivative works, including but not limited to renaming, reskinning, adding or removing features, or replacing the interface;
3. 去除、遮挡、篡改版权声明、作者署名、版本标识或许可声明；
   remove, obscure, or alter any copyright notice, attribution, version identifier, or license notice;
